  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MF5-05 Menstrual health management for girls/women with disabilities in Vanuatu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reemi Charitable Trust will work with World Vision Vanuatu to&#xa0;reach individuals from the age of menarche and above with intellectual and physical disabilities in Vanuatu&#xa0;to manage menstruation by&#xa0;providing access to education and reusable menstrual materials.&#xa0;The Activity will also deliver a Menstrual Health Management outreach programme, aimed at improving the awareness of caregivers and families to support girls and women with disabilities during menstruation.</narrative>
  </description>
